# CollectIt: Google AI Studio Build Brief (v4, ₹ + Bulk Import + Gemini AI + Payouts)

Build a complete, working, demo-ready, visually stunning **full-stack web app** called **CollectIt** for the **PayPal AI Hackathon** (it must meaningfully use both PayPal and AI, with a functional demo, not mockups). Do not ask clarifying questions; where something is unspecified, choose the simplest option that works. Prioritize a flawless end-to-end demo, real AI features, and a premium look.

---

## 1. APP OVERVIEW

**Name:** CollectIt
**Tagline:** From 5 friends to a 5,000-student fest, one link collects it all.
**What it does:** An AI-powered group money collector. A **Lead** creates a group, adds people in bulk, describes a collection in plain English, and shares one link or QR code. Members pay through **PayPal** (no account needed). The Lead sees live progress, a paid/unpaid list, AI forecasts and reminders, and finally settles the money out to their own PayPal.
**Problem:** Groups collect money through cash, screenshots, and WhatsApp reminders. The Lead never knows who has paid, and members never know where the money went.
**Users:** Leads (class reps, friend groups, club treasurers, fest teams, alumni donation drives) and Members (anyone with the link, no login).

**How PayPal and AI are used (show on the landing page and README):**
- **PayPal:** Orders API v2 (sandbox), server-side create and capture, JS SDK Smart Buttons, and a settlement/payout flow to the Lead.
- **AI (Gemini API, server-side):** six features: AI Collection Creator, AI Smart Reminders, AI Insights & Forecast, AI Spending Story, "Ask the ledger" assistant, and AI member-list Clean-up.

